    "title": "Western Springs hosts Jammin' in July with concerts and market",
    "text": "Western Springs | wikipedia.org\nWestern Springs | wikipedia.org\nWednesdays in Western Springs this July will feature a combination of music, food, and family-friendly activities. The French Market opens at 4 pm, offering a variety of unique and flavorful options.\nThe Jammin' in July concert series will take place on the Tower Green from 5 to 9 pm. It includes food trucks, a beer tent, and live music.\nORGANIZATIONS IN THIS STORY\n!RECEIVE ALERTS\nThe next time we write about any of these orgs, we’ll email you a link to the story. You may edit your settings or unsubscribe at any time.\nSign-up\nDONATE\nHelp support the Metric Media Foundation's mission to restore community based news.\nDonate",
